cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use surfbench, please cite it as below."
title: surfbench
abstract: >-
  A benchmark of implied volatility surface fits (raw SVI, SSVI, eSSVI, SABR and a
  quadratic baseline) on Deribit BTC and ETH options, scoring cross-validated accuracy,
  next-snapshot error and static-arbitrage violations with month-level confidence
  intervals.
type: software
authors:
  - name: surfbench contributors
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - implied volatility
  - volatility surface
  - SVI
  - SSVI
  - SABR
  - static arbitrage
